    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21138" root="سوب" body-key="s">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سُوبَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A long,</i> or <i>far, journey;</i> like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سُبْأَةٌ</span>;
(K, TA;) of which it is a dial. var.: a short
journey is termed <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سُرْبَةٌ</span>. (TA.)

